// Organs. Everybody has all of them, each with an integrity in 0..1.
// vital: the person dies when it reaches 0.   weight: share in the overall condition.
// heal: integrity regained per day when nothing attacks it.   value: base price in credits of a
// healthy one (organ trade).   effects: how much each trait key moves when the organ is totally
// failed (scaled linearly by the loss; same keys as traits and genes).
// afflicted_by: diseases that wear it down (their severity per day, as integrity).
